00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
Because I carry it well, doesn't mean it's not heavy.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:09,200
I've simply become fluent in the language of pretending nothing hurts, when everything does.

3
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:13,720
I make it look effortless, because falling apart was never an option.
